*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 86.67~106.67 seconds<sup>2,600f~3,200f</sup>.
