*3 [[Professor A.|Professor As]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 86.67~106.67 seconds<sup>2,600f~3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Rich cats and critters aren't needed here, since the stage gives plenty of money and there are only two metal hippoes with lackluster health. In fact, you can use the metal hippoes to stack [[Wave Attack|Waver]] or [[Long Distance]] units. The biggest threats here are the Professor As, who should be killed as soon as possible. If possible, you should complete the stage before the second and third spawn. A unit that can help with this is [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], who can tank and weaken the Professor As for other dedicated anti-red attackers like [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat) |Courier Cat]] to chip them down. Remember that all enemies spawn after 20 seconds, so you can use that to save some money and won't have to send anything out.

